# ESP-IDF build output. The pattern has no leading slash, so it matches at any
# depth -- which is why `main/build/` is covered too. (An earlier `build/` entry
# in the repo root did not cover `main/build/`, and those artifacts got
# committed before the rule existed.)
build/
sdkconfig.old

# Fetched by `idf.py component manage`; the pinned versions live in
# dependencies.lock, which IS tracked, so these are reproducible.
managed_components/

# Editor and IDE scratch
.cache/
*~
*.bak

# Runtime debug output
capture.log
dumps/

# KWS training data: ~191 MB of background noise and wake-word clips, used to
# train friday_model.tflite. Not needed to build or run the firmware, and far
# too large for the repository. `dataset/raw_audio/` is small and is kept.
dataset/background/
dataset/friday/

# Derived KWS validation set (~5 MB, 174 clips) regenerated from
# deteced_recordings/ during threshold tuning.
falsepositive_samples/

# NOTE: these are intentionally tracked, because the PC side depends on them:
#   main/                 the firmware
#   models/               the quantised KWS model and its normaliser stats
#   deteced_recordings/   real device captures; they are the calibration
#                         evidence behind stt.min_confidence in ../website
#   recording_server.py   the PC-side capture harness used to produce them
